.SH "Modules (short)"
.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRmain\&.cpp\fP — system init and task creation (FreeRTOS)
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRsystem\fP — shared data structures and access API
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRstatemachine\fP — handles mode transitions and errors
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRmeasure\fP — reads ADCs and converts to physical units
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRdisplay\fP / \fRui_screens\fP — LVGL screens and rendering
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRioexpander\fP — reads buttons/encoder and controls LEDs/fan
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRlog\fP — prints CSV lines over UART and writes to SD
.PP
.SH "Technologies"
.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
C++ (embedded)
.IP "\(bu" 2
PlatformIO
.IP "\(bu" 2
LVGL
.IP "\(bu" 2
ESP32-class microcontroller (target)
.PP
.SH "Development Principles"
.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
Modular design
.IP "\(bu" 2
Clear separation of hardware and logic
.IP "\(bu" 2
Readable, testable modules
.PP
.SH "Testing"
.PP
The \fRtest/\fP folder holds documentation for tests\&. The architecture is designed to allow adding unit and integration tests\&.
